§ `Section 68 -- Power to authorise IRD to draft Inland Revenue Bills`

-- src:473 | The Governor-General may, by Order in Council made on the recommendation of the Attorney-General, authorise the Inland Revenue Department to draft Inland Revenue Bills that the responsible Minister directs.
-- src:474 | The Order in Council may state exceptions to the authorisation.
-- src:475 | The Order in Council is secondary legislation (see this Part for publication requirements).
