#ASSERT `a person may access or download the legislation from the legislation website free of charge` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 73 -- Maker must publish secondary legislation not published by PCO (if required)`

-- src:525 | The maker of the secondary legislation must comply with the applicable publication requirements (if any) for that secondary legislation.
-- src:526 | For the purpose of this Act and any other legislation, the secondary legislation is published under this Act when the maker first complies with the applicable publication requirements.
-- Published under this Act when the maker first complies with the applicable requirements; until then, no day.
#ASSERT `the day on which the secondary legislation is published under this Act` (JUST (Date 5 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 5 3 2026)
#ASSERT `the day on which the secondary legislation is published under this Act` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 74 -- Applicable publication requirements for secondary legislation not published by PCO`

-- src:528 | The applicable publication requirements for any secondary legislation not published by the PCO are the first of the following that applies to its empowering provision:
-- src:529 | the minimum requirements that apply under regulations made under this Act (if any):
-- src:530 | the requirements recorded and published by the PCO under clause 14 of Schedule 1 (if any):
-- src:531 | the 1 or more requirements to publish, notify, or otherwise make secondary legislation available (together with any exemptions or limits on those requirements) that applied under an Act to the empowering provision immediately before this section came into force (if any).
#ASSERT `the applicable publication requirements come from` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the minimum requirements under regulations made under this Act`
#ASSERT `the applicable publication requirements come from` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the minimum requirements under regulations made under this Act`
#ASSERT `the applicable publication requirements come from` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the requirements recorded and published by the PCO under clause 14 of Schedule 1`
#ASSERT `the applicable publication requirements come from` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `the requirements recorded and published by the PCO under clause 14 of Schedule 1`
#ASSERT `the applicable publication requirements come from` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the requirements that applied under an Act to the empowering provision immediately before this section came into force`
#ASSERT `the applicable publication requirements come from` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `none`
-- src:532 | In addition, if section 75 applies to the secondary legislation, the applicable publication requirements include those set out in that section.
#ASSERT `the applicable publication requirements include those in section 75` TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the applicable publication requirements include those in section 75` FALSE EQUALS FALSE

§ `Section 75 -- Additional applicable publication requirements for secondary legislation with international transparency obligations under CPTPP`

-- src:534 | This section applies to secondary legislation not published by the PCO that—
-- src:535 | is made by a Minister or a relevant central government entity (even if the Minister or entity is performing a statutorily independent function); and
-- src:536 | relates to international transparency obligations (because the publishing under this Part of copies of and links to the legislation would help meet those obligations).
#ASSERT `section 75 applies to the secondary legislation` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `section 75 applies to the secondary legislation` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `section 75 applies to the secondary legislation` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `section 75 applies to the secondary legislation` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- src:537 | The additional applicable publication requirements for secondary legislation with international transparency obligations are that the maker must ensure that—
-- src:538 | the secondary legislation is published on the maker’s website as soon as practicable; and
-- src:539 | the secondary legislation’s details are in, or with, the secondary legislation as published on the maker’s website; and
-- src:540 | the secondary legislation and its details are, as far as practicable, able to be accessed at, or downloaded from, the maker’s website; and
-- src:541 | links to the secondary legislation are forwarded to the PCO for publication (without delay and in accordance with any applicable directions under section 76).
#ASSERT `the maker must ensure this` `publish it on the maker's website as soon as practicable` `when` TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the maker must ensure this` `publish it on the maker's website as soon as practicable` `when` FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the maker must ensure this` `include its details in, or with, it as published on the maker's website` `when` TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the maker must ensure this` `include its details in, or with, it as published on the maker's website` `when` FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the maker must ensure this` `make it and its details, as far as practicable, able to be accessed at, or downloaded from, the maker's website` `when` TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the maker must ensure this` `make it and its details, as far as practicable, able to be accessed at, or downloaded from, the maker's website` `when` FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the maker must ensure this` `forward links to it to the PCO for publication without delay and in accordance with any applicable directions under section 76` `when` TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the maker must ensure this` `forward links to it to the PCO for publication without delay and in accordance with any applicable directions under section 76` `when` FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- src:542 | Subsection (2)﻿(b) is taken to be satisfied if—
-- src:543 | the secondary legislation amends (without replacing wholly) principal secondary legislation; and
-- src:544 | the details relate to the amendments it makes to the principal secondary legislation; and
-- src:545 | the details are in or with a consolidation of the principal secondary legislation that is published as required by subsection (2).
#ASSERT `the requirement to include details is taken to be satisfied` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the requirement to include details is taken to be satisfied` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the requirement to include details is taken to be satisfied` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the requirement to include details is taken to be satisfied` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE

