§ `Section 77 -- Definitions for purposes of international transparency obligations`

-- src:563 | relevant central government entity means any of the following (or a decision-making person or body in or related to, or acting through or for, any of the following):
-- src:564 | a department named in Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Public Service Act 2020, including any departmental agency named in Part 2 of that schedule that is part of that department:
-- src:565 | an interdepartmental venture named in Part 4 of that schedule:
-- src:566 | a Crown entity (as defined in section 7(1) of the Crown Entities Act 2004, but excluding a school board and a tertiary education institution):
-- src:567 | the Reserve Bank of New Zealand:
-- src:568 | any other instrument of the Crown prescribed, for the purposes of this paragraph, by regulations made under this Act (if any).
#ASSERT `is a relevant central government entity` `a department named in Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Public Service Act 2020, including a departmental agency named in Part 2 of that schedule that is part of that department` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `is a relevant central government entity` `a department named in Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Public Service Act 2020` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `is a relevant central government entity` `a departmental agency named in Part 2 of that schedule that is part of that department` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `is a relevant central government entity` `an interdepartmental venture named in Part 4 of that schedule` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `is a relevant central government entity` `a Crown entity as defined in section 7(1) of the Crown Entities Act 2004` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `is a relevant central government entity` `a school board` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `is a relevant central government entity` `a tertiary education institution` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `is a relevant central government entity` `the Reserve Bank of New Zealand` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `is a relevant central government entity` `any other instrument of the Crown prescribed by regulations made under this Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `is a relevant central government entity` `a decision-making person or body in or related to, or acting through or for, any of the above` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `is a relevant central government entity` `any other body` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- src:558 | international transparency obligations means obligations—
