-- src:560 | under that provision as incorporated into the Comprehensive and Progressive Agreement for Trans-Pacific Partnership, done at Santiago, Chile, on 8 March 2018, by Article 1.1 of that agreement
#ASSERT `are international transparency obligations` `paragraph 5 of Article 26.2 (publication) of Chapter 26 of the Trans-Pacific Partnership Agreement done at Auckland on 4 February 2016` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `are international transparency obligations` `that provision as incorporated into the Comprehensive and Progressive Agreement for Trans-Pacific Partnership by Article 1.1 of that agreement` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `are international transparency obligations` `another obligation` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- src:562 | maker’s website means an Internet site (other than the legislation website) maintained by or on behalf of the maker
